{"version":1,"content":"<p>龔慈恩女兒林愷鈴（Ashley）有最美星二代之稱，近日更因拍劇人氣急升。</p><p>她的父親正是 90年代台灣當紅小生林煒，更意外挖出其顯赫的家族背景。</p><p>有網民起底，出生於天津的林煒，其母親為清朝皇族後裔，家族屬滿洲正黃旗，父親外祖父與清朝末代皇帝溥儀更</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T06:42:34.110660+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T06:10:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T06:38:44.483448+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T06:38:44.483448+00:00","content_hash":"57ac27baea08a8dd2835b99c84b3f6a05ea8b98ff75fbfaa1187361091101c15","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}